    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really harsh way to look at it. but it doesn't feel like punishment to me. it feels like relief. i see the way my husband sighs when he thinks i'm not looking, or how the kids try to hide how frustrated they are. if i could just take myself out of the equation, the pressure would just vanish. wouldn't it be more merciful to just stop being the problem?",
